{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 49,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER049.YBC",
      "sha256": "d87d24e38cbe12d029b95fb7c04a846b2fd64b330d71e140eed2c62d862a5cfc",
      "text_count": 264,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 206,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "唉呀唉呀，這不是露弗鐸可勞家的千金嗎。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 228,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "能夠見到妳真是榮幸之至呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 278,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "自從您加入了不動的橋墩葛斯貝布洛以後，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 300,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "我就一直認為您總有一天會有所作為。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 328,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "雖然現在您只是代理職務，\n卻已經身為四大學級之一的統帥。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 350,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "首先，我得在此對您致上最誠懇的祝賀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 396,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8,
            9
          ],
          "text": "…………\n綻放在伊諾森提雅頂端的白銀薔薇─\n帕彌菈‧露弗鐸可勞呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 418,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "這是我們第一次在正式場合下見面吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 452,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "似乎真的是這樣呢，希里鄔司‧謬斯殿下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 480,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13
          ],
          "text": "您在羅亞爾‧聖提的英勇事蹟，\n我早已有所耳聞了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 514,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "這可真是不敢當。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 554,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "在撤退的時候，您幫助我們斷後的恩情，\n我永遠不會忘記。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 588,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "那可真是一場激烈的戰鬥呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 622,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            18,
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "如果沒有聖瑟維艾斯的援助，\n葛斯貝布洛的命脈，\n也許就要在那裡斷絕了也說不定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 648,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 688,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "雖然我也曾經想過，\n或許就在那時候被毀滅了也好……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 734,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            24,
            25,
            26
          ],
          "text": "…………\n對我們純潔之盾來說，或許也是如此吧，\n殿下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 768,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "喔……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 794,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 828,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "……那麼，我想我就不用再避諱什麼了吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 854,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 888,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "像妳這樣聰明的人，應該可以瞭解啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 916,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "在這分秒必爭的危急時刻，\n是不能再浪費任何時間了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 944,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "如果妳有那個空閒去照顧這些孩子們的話，\n不如就轉而加入葛斯貝布洛吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 970,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "妳的力量，只有在葛斯貝布洛才能真正發揮。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 992,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "可惜呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1020,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            38,
            39
          ],
          "text": "妳那美麗而高貴的雙手，\n竟然要在這荒涼的大地上受盡苦勞。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1054,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "承蒙您這麼抬舉，真是令人不勝欣喜。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1094,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            41,
            42
          ],
          "text": "三年前，失去了「劍將」奧吉爾‧維因哈特，\n現在連「司法」羅沙麗亞‧奧笛納也離開了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1120,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1152,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "就算妳身為露弗鐸可勞的千金，\n可是只有一個人，又能有什麼作為呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1180,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            46,
            47
          ],
          "text": "那麼，就算只有妳能理解也好，\n至少就接受我們為各位憂慮的心意吧……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1220,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            48,
            49
          ],
          "text": "那麼，可以請您解釋一下先前送來的信，\n所想表達的是什麼意思嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1260,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51
          ],
          "text": "能夠如願地見到妳，\n就表示那封信的任務已經達成了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1286,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            52
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1326,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            53,
            54
          ],
          "text": "如果能夠得到妳的幫助的話，\n現在就可以讓妳坐上四大天王的寶座。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1360,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "真是令我感到榮幸呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1394,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "這個自然。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1428,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "然而，殿下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1456,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "在現在的純潔之盾裡，\n有從聖瑟維艾斯加入的法娜‧修貝流士。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1484,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            60,
            61
          ],
          "text": "也有從不動的橋墩來到這裡的艾爾雪‧貝爾薩\n。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1510,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1542,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            63,
            64
          ],
          "text": "有著雖然還不成熟，\n卻正在穩定成長的孩子們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1576,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "總之……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1610,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            66,
            67,
            68
          ],
          "text": "那就是說，\n你們收容了許多流著招致混沌之血的聖瑟維艾\n斯餘孽嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1636,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            69
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1662,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            70
          ],
          "text": "如果純潔之盾還為了愛爾梅納斯著想的話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1690,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            71,
            72
          ],
          "text": "不是應該認清他們那引發混沌的血脈，\n並且給他們應得的懲戒嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1724,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "您是說，要我們眼睜睜地看著他們受苦嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1758,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1780,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "難道，妳打算繼續庇護混沌的同黨嗎。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1814,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾無法認同這種事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1842,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            77,
            78
          ],
          "text": "聖瑟維艾斯所遭受的冤情，\n就由我們來洗雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1876,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            79
          ],
          "text": "就算那是賢者圓桌所下的判決也好？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1910,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            80
          ],
          "text": "就算是賢者，也只不過是人而已。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1932,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "是人就有可能會出錯不是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 1972,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            82,
            83
          ],
          "text": "要是我們連那些賢者的決定都不遵從的話，\n又該要遵從些什麼呢！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2012,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            84,
            85
          ],
          "text": "…………\n那就遵從自己心中的信念吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2046,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "愚蠢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2080,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "我是這樣地被教導的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2102,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            88
          ],
          "text": "……和您的想法似乎不太一樣呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2136,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            89
          ],
          "text": "……也就是說，你們要反抗賢者圓桌囉？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2164,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            90,
            91
          ],
          "text": "就憑你們這些只能緬懷過去光榮的，\n可悲的伊諾森提雅！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2186,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            92
          ],
          "text": "就憑這些毫無能力可言的孩子們！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2232,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            93,
            94,
            95
          ],
          "text": "……如果大樹會去嘲笑樹苗的矮小的話，\n那麼殿下，\n也許你現在做的事情就是對的吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2260,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            96,
            97
          ],
          "text": "確實，在充滿陽光的溫室裡所培育的鮮綠，\n是十分地美麗。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2286,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            98
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2324,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            99,
            100,
            101
          ],
          "text": "然而，只有在這荒涼的大地上，\n為了吸收水分，堅忍地努力紮根向下，\n才會結出豐美的果實。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2352,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            102,
            103
          ],
          "text": "然而，究竟哪一種才能支撐這愛爾梅納斯呢？\n這誰也不能確定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2378,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            104
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2418,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            105,
            106
          ],
          "text": "總有一天，在不遠的將來，\n那些孩子們將會碰到不得不低頭的難關。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2452,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            107,
            108,
            109
          ],
          "text": "而在那樣的時候，\n請至少注意不要讓他們那高傲揚起的鼻子，\n重重地摔在自己的膝前。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2492,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            110,
            111
          ],
          "text": "妳現在……\n正在愚弄我希里鄔司‧謬斯嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2526,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            112
          ],
          "text": "我並不敢如此冒犯殿下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2560,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            113,
            114,
            115
          ],
          "text": "如果您認為我所說的話另有所指，\n那麼就算是您要立刻把我的舌頭給拔下來，\n我也毫無怨言。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2594,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            116
          ],
          "text": "白銀的薔薇，帕彌菈‧露弗鐸可勞！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2616,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            117
          ],
          "text": "堅持要庇護混沌的愚蠢女人呀！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2644,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            118,
            119
          ],
          "text": "難道妳的意思是，\n你們絲毫也不想拯救愛爾梅納斯嗎！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2670,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            120
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2704,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            121
          ],
          "text": "原來這就是純潔之盾所希望的嗎！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2732,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            122,
            123
          ],
          "text": "寧可要守護那令人忌恨的混沌，\n而讓自己的故鄉毀滅嗎！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2790,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            124
          ],
          "text": "……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2824,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            125
          ],
          "text": "那些無處可以容身……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2852,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            126,
            127
          ],
          "text": "連想在冰冷的雨中找一塊屋簷遮蔽，\n都沒有辦法的孩子，又該怎麼辦？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2878,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            128
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2918,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            129,
            130
          ],
          "text": "是的，我們純潔之盾現在還很弱小，\n的確是很脆弱。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2946,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            131,
            132
          ],
          "text": "現在，就算你的劍僅是稍稍地揮動一下也好，\n那脆弱的羽翼就連掙扎的空間都將沒有了呀！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 2972,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            133
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3012,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            134,
            135
          ],
          "text": "無論是什麼人也好，\n當然都會想要守護自己的故鄉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3040,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            136,
            137
          ],
          "text": "然而，連那倒在眼前痛苦喘息的幼小生命，\n都可以見死不救……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3062,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            138
          ],
          "text": "這樣又怎麼有可能拯救愛爾梅納斯呢……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3088,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            139
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3122,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            140
          ],
          "text": "你瞭解了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3150,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            141,
            142
          ],
          "text": "那些孩子們，\n是以自己的意志選擇加入純潔之盾的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3178,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            143,
            144
          ],
          "text": "就算必須在痛苦中匍伏，也要在地上掙扎著前\n進。而你不但不能體會那些孩子們的心情，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3218,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            145,
            146
          ],
          "text": "反而還要指責這些同在學舍中求學、\n無可替代的同伴們是混沌的爪牙嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3240,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            147
          ],
          "text": "他們的覺悟與思念之深重……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3262,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            148
          ],
          "text": "你這一輩子都沒有辦法趕上的！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3296,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            149
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3342,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            150,
            151,
            152
          ],
          "text": "…………\n也許可以算是你幸運吧，\n那些幼小的孩子們現在並不在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3364,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            153
          ],
          "text": "如果他們全部都在場的話……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3416,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            154,
            155,
            156,
            157
          ],
          "text": "不要以為從你那高傲的口中，\n還能說出要我們「臣服於不動的四天王之下」\n的妄言哪！\n你可千萬別忘記呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3450,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            158
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3484,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            159
          ],
          "text": "請容我告退。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3526,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            160
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3628,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            161
          ],
          "text": "純潔之盾還真的是有很優秀的支柱呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3670,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            162
          ],
          "text": "殿下……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3696,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            163
          ],
          "text": "……那我們就遵從賢者圓桌的命令吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3722,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            164
          ],
          "text": "……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3748,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            165
          ],
          "text": "討伐伊諾森提雅。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3774,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            166
          ],
          "text": "……那就趕快通知大家吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3806,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            167,
            168
          ],
          "text": "加德摩斯。\n只要帶著四大天王一起就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3832,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            169
          ],
          "text": "可是那……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3858,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            170
          ],
          "text": "難道你認為我們會輸嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3896,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            171,
            172,
            173
          ],
          "text": "……那也並不是不可能的。\n就算我們在數量上有壓倒性的優勢，\n也沒辦法擊碎純潔之盾堅定的意志。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3922,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            174
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3954,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            175,
            176
          ],
          "text": "我們也只有做好應有的準備，\n而戰果如何，就不是我們可以預料的了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 3992,
          "speaker_id": 11,
          "speaker": "希里鄔司",
          "text_indices": [
            177,
            178,
            179
          ],
          "text": "好吧。\n那麼就在兩週後，\n讓他們見識我們葛斯貝布洛的力量。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4018,
          "speaker_id": 19,
          "speaker": "加德摩斯",
          "text_indices": [
            180
          ],
          "text": "遵命……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4134,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            181,
            182
          ],
          "text": "如果不讓那稚氣未脫的孩子們，\n受一點挫折的話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4156,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            183
          ],
          "text": "……我想他是不會有所成長的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4200,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            184,
            185
          ],
          "text": "我不這麼認為。\n謬斯家可是位列貝爾鐸可勞大公的大世家呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4226,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            186
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4256,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            187,
            188,
            189
          ],
          "text": "一旦時機來到，\n他可能會是與我不相上下的對手呢。\n他可不是妳可以冒犯的人呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4296,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            190,
            191
          ],
          "text": "雖然這麼說，\n但我當時可是很努力地想要謹守禮節呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4322,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            192
          ],
          "text": "哈哈，原來是這樣啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4362,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            193,
            194
          ],
          "text": "葛斯貝布洛裡所集結的，\n是一群忠肝義膽的勇敢劍士。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4390,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            195,
            196
          ],
          "text": "現在由那個孩子領導著，\n也許會讓他們展現出全新的風貌吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4416,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            197
          ],
          "text": "難道妳覺得他的才能就只有這樣嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4450,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            198
          ],
          "text": "或許是吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4476,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            199
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4510,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            200
          ],
          "text": "您有注意到嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4538,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            201,
            202
          ],
          "text": "剛才那孩子的眼神，\n就連一瞬間也沒有鬆懈過。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4564,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            203
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4604,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            204,
            205
          ],
          "text": "雖然這麼說實在很不甘心，\n現在我們已經回到了這白皙的城砦……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4632,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            206,
            207
          ],
          "text": "但是對伊諾森提雅現在的實力來說，\n不論有怎樣的計畫，也都只是空想罷了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4666,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            208
          ],
          "text": "因此。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4694,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            209,
            210
          ],
          "text": "懇求您能夠領導我們，\n迎向那即將來臨的勝利。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4720,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            211
          ],
          "text": "當然，正這是我打算要做的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4754,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            212
          ],
          "text": "……我先告退了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4816,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            213,
            214,
            215
          ],
          "text": "《並不是只有優雅而已，\n　那堅定的心靈，高尚的潔操，\n　強烈的熱情都和她的父親一樣。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4846,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            216,
            217,
            218
          ],
          "text": "《這是因為老師不僅僅是教導我，\n　而且對他的女兒也沒有分別地，\n　嚴格地去教導嗎……》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4944,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            219
          ],
          "text": "看來他是失敗了嘛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 4992,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            220,
            221
          ],
          "text": "的確。\n不過那孩子的口才已經算是很好的了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5018,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            222
          ],
          "text": "羅弗利。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5062,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            223,
            224,
            225,
            226
          ],
          "text": "不過，那也是因為他碰上的對手是帕彌菈呀。\n他就算使出了全力也贏不了吧。\n到去年為止，\n她可是連被辯成平手的紀錄都沒有呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5094,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            227,
            228
          ],
          "text": "對帕彌菈來說，\n無論哪個孩子都是很可愛的吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5144,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            229,
            230,
            231,
            232,
            233
          ],
          "text": "嗯，是啊。\n純潔之盾失去了奧爾菲，現在的帕彌菈，\n就像年幼的伊諾森提雅的母親一般。\n不管有什麼理由，一旦自己的小孩被侮辱，\n沒有任何父母會不生氣吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5182,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            234,
            235,
            236
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，說不定就是這樣……\n而且除了那個原因之外，\n她應該也很關心希里鄔司這個少年吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5232,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            237,
            238,
            239,
            240,
            241
          ],
          "text": "呼呼。\n這麼說，我們那如同金色黃昏的朋友啊，\n真的是教出了相當優秀而美麗的三人組呢。\n光是想想看要怎麼去做，\n就已經讓我感覺辛苦到不行了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5270,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            242,
            243,
            244
          ],
          "text": "但是在那三個人之中，其中兩個人已經離開了\n，伊諾森提雅的重責大任，\n就要由帕彌菈一個人來擔當了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5320,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            245,
            246,
            247,
            248,
            249
          ],
          "text": "反正，要好好努力減輕她的負擔，\n這應該是對恩師情深意重的你的工作呀。\n畢竟這些孩子們的資質也很好嘛。\n而且各式各樣的個性都有，\n你可以隨便選幾個來教啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5358,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            250,
            251,
            252
          ],
          "text": "那你為什麼不接下純潔之盾的指揮杖咧？\n羅弗利。\n老師應該有問過你吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5408,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            253,
            254,
            255,
            256,
            257
          ],
          "text": "如果有那個可能的話，在他沒說之前，\n我應該就已經逃得遠遠的了吧。\n你應該知道吧？　所謂的接下指揮杖，\n就表示要當四大學級的領導，\n這種苦悶到了極點的工作呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5434,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            258
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5472,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            259,
            260,
            261
          ],
          "text": "總之，如果真的要我接手，我是不會答應的。\n何況老師他是一丁點兒要找我接棒的意思都沒\n有啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 49,
          "source_offset": 5504,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            262,
            263
          ],
          "text": "什麼？\n只不過就是這樣而已，就是這樣而已。"
        }
      ],
